WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.134 --> 00:00:18.885
The possum looked closely at Toad.

2
00:00:18.886 --> 00:00:23.018
"Did you say you are a toad?" she asked.

3
00:00:23.019 --> 00:00:25.412
She stepped closer.

4
00:00:25.413 --> 00:00:28.939
"You are a toad!" she screamed.

5
00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:32.418
Toad backed away from her.

6
00:00:32.419 --> 00:00:35.802
"I don't like toads at all!" she yelled.

7
00:00:35.803 --> 00:00:38.672
She grabbed him by the leg.

8
00:00:38.673 --> 00:00:43.757
"Stop! Let go of me!" cried Toad.

9
00:00:43.758 --> 00:00:47.873
She swung him around three times!

10
00:00:47.874 --> 00:00:51.244
"Ahhh," cried Toad.

11
00:00:51.245 --> 00:00:53.738
"I'm getting dizzy!"

12
00:00:53.739 --> 00:00:57.760
"Get off my boat!" the possum yelled.

13
00:00:57.761 --> 00:01:00.935
Then she let him go.

14
00:01:00.936 --> 00:01:04.024
Toad flew through the air.

15
00:01:04.025 --> 00:01:06.878
He went over the side of the boat.

16
00:01:06.879 --> 00:01:13.957
"Ahhh!" screamed Toad. "I'm falling!"

17
00:01:13.958 --> 00:01:18.872
With a splash, Toad fell into the water.

18
00:01:18.873 --> 00:01:21.094
Toad coughed.

19
00:01:21.095 --> 00:01:24.871
"The water is cold!" he cried.

20
00:01:24.872 --> 00:01:27.716
His bonnet was soaked.

21
00:01:27.717 --> 00:01:30.746
A lily pad covered his head.

22
00:01:30.747 --> 00:01:35.555
The possum looked back and laughed.

23
00:01:35.556 --> 00:01:41.480
"I'll get you!" yelled Toad, shaking his fist.

24
00:01:41.481 --> 00:01:44.153
"You'll be sorry!"

25
00:01:44.154 --> 00:01:48.668
Toad swam to shore and climbed out.

26
00:01:48.669 --> 00:01:54.339
"This dress is heavy, but I can still run!" said Toad.

27
00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:58.471
He ran along the path beside the canal.

28
00:01:58.472 --> 00:02:04.334
"Up I go!" yelled Toad as he jumped on the horse.

29
00:02:04.335 --> 00:02:08.678
"Let me untie you, horse," cried Toad.

30
00:02:08.679 --> 00:02:14.822
"Now you are as free as I am!"

31
00:02:14.823 --> 00:02:18.810
"Stop! Stop!" yelled the possum.

32
00:02:18.811 --> 00:02:23.747
"No one can stop Toad!" Toad shouted.

33
00:02:23.748 --> 00:02:31.045
And he rode away laughing.
